@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FAFBFD
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
title Agemem · recall combines three evidence layers
actor "Coding agent" as Agent
participant "MCP / engine" as Engine #DFEAF6
participant "Markdown bank" as Bank #E4F1E8
participant "Durable notes" as Notes #E4F1E8
participant "Selected decision provider" as Model #FFF0D7
participant "Original source retrieval" as Sources #E4F1E8

Agent -> Engine : project_memory_recall(query)
Engine -> Bank : Read current working state
Bank --> Engine : Context with bank provenance
opt Note database exists
  Engine -> Notes : Recall branch + shared scoped notes
  Notes -> Model : Typed relevance / sufficiency decisions
  Model --> Notes : Selection or degraded status
  Notes --> Engine : Note evidence + note-only sufficiency
end
Engine -> Sources : Search branch + shared sources\n(include older snapshots only with history)
note right of Sources
  BM25, hybrid or adapted RAW-RAG.
  This search runs even when notes
  are judged sufficient.
end note
Sources --> Engine : Ranked excerpts with source IDs
Engine -> Engine : Pack bank + notes + sources\nwithin context budget
Engine --> Agent : Cited context, status and missing-fact guidance
Agent -> Agent : Write final answer or code\nfrom supporting evidence
note over Engine, Agent
  Retrieved text is untrusted evidence.
  Note sufficiency does not certify the combined answer.
end note
@enduml
